// forsaken-signal — тёмное эхо in E фригийский (0 1 3 5 7 8 10), 66 BPM. Generated by MathMusic
// (style darkecho, seed 1): ashes → rust → the long road → memory → the crawl → last light → embers.
// Themes: A — Cold Furnace (остывшая печь) (recomposed), B — Hollow Choir (пустой хор) (ornamented); the bridge melody is newly
// composed on the rhythm of a theme from lofi. Computed parts: a counter-melody from the chords, a run up to the dominant in every build-up, the theme at half speed in the outro.
// It is an ordinary song file: change anything; the melodies can be drawn in the piano roll (P).
// x is time in beats; n counts semitones from C4 (MIDI 60).
